creature Election
  traits
    candidate_a_votes is a number
    candidate_b_votes is a number
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait candidate_a_votes to 0
    give self the trait candidate_b_votes to 0
  end born
end creature

creature Voter
  traits
    name is text
    has_voted is true or false
  end traits

  when born with (name)
    give self the trait name to name
    give self the trait has_voted to false
  end born

  action vote_a
    when self has_voted == false
      when self knows anyone as ballot_box
        give box to self ballot_box
        give box the trait candidate_a_votes to box candidate_a_votes + 1
        give self the trait has_voted to true
        say self name + " voted for Candidate A."
      end when
    otherwise
      say self name + " already voted!"
    end when
  end action

  action vote_b
    when self has_voted == false
      when self knows anyone as ballot_box
        give box to self ballot_box
        give box the trait candidate_b_votes to box candidate_b_votes + 1
        give self the trait has_voted to true
        say self name + " voted for Candidate B."
      end when
    otherwise
      say self name + " already voted!"
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring TownElection to life as Election

bring Voter1 to life as Voter with ("John")
bring Voter2 to life as Voter with ("Jane")
bring Voter3 to life as Voter with ("Doe")

Voter1 knows TownElection as ballot_box
Voter2 knows TownElection as ballot_box
Voter3 knows TownElection as ballot_box

Voter1 does vote_a
Voter2 does vote_b
Voter1 does vote_b
Voter3 does vote_a

announce "Candidate A: " + TownElection candidate_a_votes
announce "Candidate B: " + TownElection candidate_b_votes
